   367	## 7. Stable error mapping
   368	
   369	Never expose raw localized platform error strings as identifiers. Retain
   370	redacted domain/code for diagnostics.
   371	
   372	| Source | Stable result |
   373	|---|---|
   374	| `NEVPNError.configurationInvalid` | `configurationInvalid` |
   375	| `NEVPNError.configurationDisabled` | `configurationDisabled` |
   376	| `NEVPNError.connectionFailed` | `connectionFailed` |
   377	| `NEVPNError.configurationStale` after one retry | `concurrentModification` |
   378	| `NEVPNError.configurationReadWriteFailed` | `preferencesReadWriteFailed` |
   379	| `NEVPNError.configurationUnknown` | `preferencesUnknown` |
   380	| non-NEVPN error during save/enable authorization | `authorizationFailed(domain, code)` |
   381	| preference deadline / local cancellation | `preferencesTimedOut` / `operationCancelled` |
